    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "dfd838421089e7516d7522ea353e389f1608067d08cbc2b26ff03faf99c93454",
      "text": "Transfer to the airport (driver only) and flight to Patagonia. Meet and transfer to the hotel with an English-speaking guide. Check-in at EOLO (Corner Room).\n\nIn the evening — \"Nativo Experience\": a 4x4 journey along the shores of Lake Argentino to the Cuevas de Walichu — an archaeological site on rocky cliffs overlooking the lake and the Cordillera de los Andes. Here, rock paintings left by the Tehuelche people thousands of years ago have been preserved — a window into Patagonia's ancient history. The excursion concludes with an authentic Patagonian dinner inside the cave itself, with an English-speaking guide, beneath a starlit sky in the silence of the steppe.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1QkTe_ZNywIecx29otLIyGHjhNP_KgAhn",
        "documentSha256": "658d28ef6440ba90d2b71eaa4473f9c03585ab1da92957aee5deaf15c7f25952",
